								"folders"
							]
						},
						"description": "Create a new folder in the user's storage.\n\n**Authentication:** Requires a valid JWT token in the X-From-The-Hart-Authorization header.\n\n**Path Requirements:**\n- Must end with a trailing slash (e.g., 'media/')\n- Must not start with a leading slash\n- Must not contain '//' sequences\n- Must not contain '.' or '..' path segments\n\n**Parent Folder Requirements:**\n- Parent folder must exist before creating nested folders\n- Root-level folders (e.g., 'media/') can be created without a parent\n\n**Idempotent Operation:**\n- Creating an existing folder returns the folder metadata without error\n\n**Examples:**\n- Root folder: {\"path\": \"media/\"}\n- Nested folder: {\"path\": \"media/photos/\"} (requires 'media/' to exist)"
					},
